OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of items get new homes
OL,4,Aat recycling shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shop selling unwanted household items
OL,7,Ffrom a recycling centre has expanded
OL,8,Fafter more than 2,100 items were bought
OL,9,Fin its first year.
OL,11,FThe reuse shop at New Romney Household
OL,12,FWaste Recycling Centre sells pre-loved
OL,13,Fgoods brought to the site by residents,
OL,14,Fgiving shoppers the chance to pick up
OL,15,F"new-to-you" household bargains, Kent
OL,16,FCounty Council (KCC) said.
OL,18,FShoppers can browse through everything
OL,19,Ffrom furniture and bags to kitchenware,
OL,20,Fbooks, ornaments and paintings.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
